<title>USA: Williams files $350 mln shelf of debt,pfd.</title>
<headline>Williams files $350 mln shelf of debt,pfd.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Williams Holdings Plc filed Monday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission a shelf offering of up to $350 million in debt securities and preferred shares.</p>
<p>Together with a previous registration, the shelf offering totals $500 million.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale of the securities will be used for general corporate purposes including funding of the company's capital program.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the SEC filing.</p>
</text>
